<title>USA: Express Scripts adds one mln new members.</title>
<headline>Express Scripts adds one mln new members.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Express Scripts Inc said Thursday that it added about one million new members during the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>This increased total enrollment in its pharmacy benefit management programs by 10.1 percent to 10.9 million from 9.9 milion at the end of 1996.</p>
<p>Since March 31, 1996, membership has increased 21.1 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;Express Scripts added a significant number of new members during the first quarter of the year as we finalized several important contracts,&quot; Barrett Toan, president, said in a statement.</p>
<p>(Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
